  Description: "Big thanks to crecheng for sourcecode.  can copy  some part of planet
    and paste and shift move along the equator ----------\u661F\u7403\u84DD\u56FE-\u590D\u5236\u5F53\u524D\u661F\u7403\u7684\u5168\u90E8\u5EFA\u7B51
